Drop a raw ChemDraw clipboard CDX payload into this directory as:

  test/files/chemdraw_clipboard_sample.cdx

Expected payload characteristics from Avogadro clipboard capture:
- MIME: application/x-qt-windows-mime;value="ChemDraw Interchange Format"
- First 8 bytes: 56 6a 43 44 30 31 30 30 (ASCII "VjCD0100")
- Embedded CDX offset: 0

The Open Babel regression tests 3440 and 3450 will automatically pick this file up.
If it is absent, tests fall back to ethanol.cdx to keep CI coverage active.
